  progressTowardsObjective: 0
  fileContents: "Date: August \uFFFD7, 31\uFFFD8\r\nSource: Public Shortwave Radio Broadcast\r\nRE: Emergency Distress Signal \u2014 Yanthem\r\n\r\n\uFFFD\uFFFD\uFFFD He\uFFFD\uFFFDo? Is anyone receiving this? Yanthem is under attack by the very security droids assigned to protect us, and we have no idea what\u2019s ca\uFFFD\uFFFD\uFFFDing this. (Gunfire and screaming heard in the background) Please, we need help! The cell towers are down, and I don't know how much longer we can h\uFFFD\uFFFD\uFFFD out here. If anyone can hear this, please send som\uFFFD\uFFFD\uFFFDne, we're at \u2588\u2592?\xD7[DATA_LOST]\u2588\u2593 ... oh God, they're insi\uFFFD\uFFFD\uFFFD\u2014\r\n\r\n[SIGNAL LOST \u2014 END OF TRANSMISSION]"
  image: {fileID: 0}
